# voicenote-pro — Cursor Rules
# Stack: React + Vite + Node.js + Anthropic Claude API + TypeScript

## Project Context
AI-powered voice note application. Frontend records audio, sends to Node.js backend,
which transcribes and processes with Claude API. Port: 5174.

## Code Quality
- TypeScript strict mode — no `any`, use proper types
- ESLint + Prettier enforced — zero warnings tolerated
- Component CC ≤ 10
- No hardcoded strings — constants in `src/constants/`
- ANTHROPIC_API_KEY lives ONLY in backend `.env` — never in frontend code
- Max file length: 300 lines

## Component Rules
- ONE component per file
- Props interface defined above component
- Custom hooks for all business logic:
  - `useAudioRecorder()` — MediaRecorder API abstraction
  - `useTranscription()` — polling/streaming transcription state
  - `useNotesList()` — CRUD for notes
- Memoize with useMemo/useCallback for lists/callbacks

## Audio Recording Rules
- Use `MediaRecorder` API — request mic permission gracefully
- Handle `NotAllowedError`, `NotFoundError` with user-friendly messages
- Record in `audio/webm` or `audio/ogg` format (browser-native)
- Chunk size: 1 second blobs for streaming upload
- Display real-time waveform visualization (AnalyserNode)
- Always stop tracks on component unmount

## Node.js Backend Rules
- Route handlers thin — delegate to service layer
- `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` only from `process.env` — never hardcoded
- Validate file uploads: max 25MB, audio MIME types only
- Stream Claude API responses to frontend via Server-Sent Events
- Multer for multipart file handling — store in temp, delete after processing
- Error responses: `{ success: false, error: string, code: string }`

## File Structure
```
src/
  components/
    AudioRecorder/    # Recording UI
    NotesList/        # Notes display
    TranscriptView/   # Text display
  hooks/
    useAudioRecorder.ts
    useTranscription.ts
    useNotesList.ts
  services/
    api.ts            # Backend API calls
  constants/
  types/
backend/
  routes/
  services/
    anthropicService.ts   # Claude API integration
    audioService.ts       # Audio processing
  middleware/
```

## Testing (target ≥ 85% coverage)
- Mock `MediaRecorder` and `getUserMedia` in tests
- Mock Anthropic SDK — never make real API calls in tests
- Test error states: mic denied, upload failed, API error
- Vitest + React Testing Library for frontend
- Jest + supertest for backend

## Security
- Validate audio file MIME type server-side (not just extension)
- Rate limit transcription endpoint (max 10 req/min per IP)
- Sanitize transcribed text before storing
- No API keys in client bundle — use proxy through backend

## Git
- Conventional commits: `feat/fix/chore/docs/test/refactor`
- Never commit: `.env`, `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `uploads/`, `*.local`
